# Share of /work requests that ended with a 5xx code, over 5 minutes.
# Code 499 (client abandoned the request) is not counted as an error.
# Returns no data when /work received no requests in the window.
# Returns 0 when /work received requests and none had a 5xx code.
# Run in: Prometheus explorer of the Azure Monitor workspace pp-dev-amw.
# Reads: http_requests_total (labels route, code).
(sum(rate(http_requests_total{route="/work", code=~"5.."}[5m])) or vector(0))
/
sum(rate(http_requests_total{route="/work"}[5m]))
